# The region between the markers is quoted verbatim in README.md as the environment a
# container platform hands this server. ReadmeEtcdConfigurationExamplesTests binds it as an
# environment rather than as properties, which is what proves the spelling: a list from one
# variable is the shape a platform can hand over and the one an operator is most likely to
# get wrong.

# tag::server-etcd-env[]
REDIS_ADAPTER_ETCD_ENDPOINTS=http://etcd-0:2379,http://etcd-1:2379
REDIS_ADAPTER_ETCD_KEY_PREFIX=/redis-adapter/
# end::server-etcd-env[]
